      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Changing the platform indicator could cause some confusion that Desktop, PCVR and Android are different platforms.\n\nOne other idea I had was changing the status circle to VR/Desktop icons, but it's probably better to just keep the status symbol simple. Maybe adding a separate icon next to the status symbol could work?\n\nOr maybe just adding a separate icon somewhere in general.",
