  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm kinda surprised that I couldn't find a canny for this, so I'm making one.\nWhile scrolling my friends list, it would be nice to see who is in Desktop mode and who is in PCVR mode.\nA lot of people nowadays do have VR equipment, but still commonly play VRChat in desktop mode. \nI think it would help, if you could check the website for example to see how many people in your friends list are in VR to help you decide if you wanna hop on VRChat in VR mode or desktop mode.\nI think it would make most sense to just modify the existing platform indicator to just differentiate PCVR and Desktop, but still treat them as the PC-platform.",
